OL,3,GNEWSAToys impeded fatal crash driver's
OL,4,Aview, police say
OL,5,
OL,6,FStuffed toys dangling from a rear-view
OL,7,Fmirror obstructed a driver's view
OL,8,Fshortly before she fatally struck a
OL,9,Fgrandfather, police have said.
OL,11,FRosemarie Oszko hit 81-year-old John
OL,12,FNottingham with her vehicle close to
OL,13,Fthe junction of Waterton Road and
OL,14,FDewsbury Road in Wakefield on 1 March
OL,15,F2024.
OL,17,FOszko, 65, was sentenced to eight
OL,18,Fmonths in prison, suspended for two
OL,19,Fyears, at Leeds Crown Court earlier.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
