OL,3,GNEWSAToys impeded fatal crash driver's
OL,4,Aview, police say
OL,5,
OL,6,FWest Yorkshire said the two toys had a
OL,7,F"significant effect" on visibility from
OL,8,Fthe driving seat and that the defendant
OL,9,F"would have had a clearer view of Mr
OL,10,FNottingham" had the toys not been
OL,11,Fthere.
